# deployments.json is deliberately NOT ignored. The backend requires it at
# runtime for contract addresses, and it cannot be regenerated without
# deploying — so a host building from a clean clone has to find it in the repo
# or fail at boot. It holds addresses and a chainId, never a key.
*.log
